tls: keep the full uTLS key-share list in the Reality client

The Reality client removed X25519MLKEM768 from the supported groups and
key shares of the selected uTLS fingerprint. Send the fingerprint's
groups and key shares unchanged so current Xray REALITY servers accept
the Client Hello. Same change as openrung/sing-box commit 121da7ad15,
plus a regression test.

